WAVE 10
	MILESTONE "save-manager-navigation"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-navigation"
	DESC "the save manager is navigated by pages from a left menu, its shell fed by the first view"
		+ "models cut by view: the save identity, the players menu and the Configuration page; the"
		+ "other pages still read the section view models, and the merge notice joins the wave"
		REF @URL.SaveManagerRedesignMockup
		REF @DECISION.AViewModelServesOneView

WAVE 11
	MILESTONE "save-manager-planets"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-planets"
	DESC "the Power, Terraformation and Overview pages and the planet page read view models of"
		+ "their own, figures and statuses decided by the domain and rendered by the presenters,"
		+ "the power chart and the SysTi included"
		REF @URL.SaveManagerRedesignMockup
		REF @DECISION.AViewModelServesOneView

WAVE 12
	MILESTONE "save-manager-players"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-players"
	DESC "the Players page reads a view model of its own, the section controllers no page reads are"
		+ "retired, and the whole save manager is usable at phone width and by keyboard"
		REF @URL.SaveManagerRedesignMockup
		REF @DECISION.AViewModelServesOneView

WAVE 13
	MILESTONE "save-manager-history"
	BRANCH "integration/save-manager-history"
	DESC "the save manager keeps the saves loaded in the browser once the reader asks for it, lists"
		+ "them on the Load save page to load them again or remove them, and lets the reader clear"
		+ "them and bound how long they stay; the loaded save and the merge result survive an"
		+ "address entered by hand"
	SOURCE "Owner ruling of 2026-09-28 when FEAT151 was refined: the saves loaded before are kept"
		+ "in a wave of their own, not in wave 10"
		PR 211
